  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Mix together sazón, coconut cream, onion, ginger, garlic, cilantro, red pepper, salt, and black pepper in a bowl.",
    "Toss carrots and potatoes with a little oil and roast in the oven for 15 minutes.",
    "Add the roasted vegetables to the bowl with the sazón mixture and stir to combine.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a baking dish and top with yogurt.",
    "Bake for an additional 10-15 minutes, until the top is lightly browned.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional cilantro if desired."
